### Milestone 4 - Certification Exam and reports (Intern 4)

| Method | Path | Access | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| GET | `/business/certification/levels` | Public | Lists fixed sign sets and pass thresholds for all four levels. |
| POST | `/business/certification/exams` | Learner bearer token | Submits one complete multi-sign exam and returns pass/fail plus a certificate id for passes. |
| GET | `/business/reports/me?report_type=<type>&format=<format>` | Learner bearer token | Downloads one of five reports as `pdf` or `xlsx`. |
| GET | `/business/summary/me` | Learner bearer token | Live totals for the learner dashboard. |
| GET | `/business/analytics/me` | Learner bearer token | Live JSON attempt history and chart data for the frontend reports view. |

`level` must be one of `Beginner`, `Intermediate`, `Advanced`, or
`Professional`. A submission must contain every listed sign exactly once. The
thresholds are 70, 75, 80 and 85 respectively. Each answer's score uses the
existing model-confidence output only when its predicted sign matches the
expected sign; a mismatch scores zero.

```json
{
  "level": "Beginner",
  "answers": [
    {"expected_label": "A", "predicted_label": "A", "confidence": 0.98},
    {"expected_label": "B", "predicted_label": "B", "confidence": 0.96},
    {"expected_label": "C", "predicted_label": "C", "confidence": 0.95},
    {"expected_label": "D", "predicted_label": "D", "confidence": 0.97},
    {"expected_label": "E", "predicted_label": "E", "confidence": 0.99}
  ]
}
```

```json
{
  "exam_id": 14,
  "level": "Beginner",
  "score": 97.0,
  "pass_score": 70,
  "passed": true,
  "certificate_id": "CERT-AB12CD34EF"
}
```

Valid report types are `learning`, `assessment`, `accuracy`, `certification`,
and `progress`. Valid formats are `pdf` and `xlsx`.

